<Layout 
  title="Teaching Staff & Faculty Directory - Don Bosco School Shirva"
  description="Meet our dedicated educators, academic coordinators, and specialized faculty at Don Bosco English Medium School Shirva. Full staff directory and CBSE mandatory staff disclosure."
>
